  "details": "Instead of forcing creators to tag their creations as using AI (as we all know they probably wont all do it), give the options to player to be able to block world list from creators they dont want to see in their search results. This would avoid the devs from having to work on 1000 of reports about misslabeled worlds, and also give the opportunity for peoples to block other type of worlds they dont enjoy to see in their search (ex: missleading ai thumbnail, single room cozy world number 1million, peoples you blocked and you dont want to see their creations either..)",
